---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="500 | Algo salió mal — Domina" description="Ocurrió un error interno temporal.">
  <main class="page-500">
    <div class="container grid-500">
      <section>
        <span class="eyebrow eyebrow-acid">Error interno</span>
        <div class="code-500">5<span>0</span>0</div>
        <h1>La plataforma necesita un momento.</h1>
        <p class="copy">Algo falló al procesar esta página. Tus datos no deberían verse afectados. Puedes volver a intentarlo o regresar a una sección estable de Domina.</p>
        
        <form class="search-500" action="/cursos" method="GET">
          <input name="q" aria-label="Buscar cursos o guías" placeholder="Buscar uñas, pastelería, IA…" />
          <button type="submit">Buscar</button>
        </form>

        <div class="actions">
          <button class="btn btn-acid" id="retryBtn">Intentar de nuevo ↻</button>
          <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/">Ir al inicio</a>
          <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/contacto">Reportar problema</a>
        </div>

        <p class="incident">Código de referencia visual: DOM-500 · Si el problema continúa, indícanos qué estabas intentando abrir.</p>
      </section>

      <aside class="machine" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="bolt"></span>
        <div class="panel-500">
          <div class="panel-head">
            <i class="dot-500 orange"></i>
            <i class="dot-500 yellow"></i>
            <i class="dot-500 lime"></i>
          </div>
          <div class="screen-500">
            <div class="line-500 v"></div>
            <div class="line-500"></div>
            <div class="line-500"></div>
            <div class="line-500 o"></div>
            <div class="line-500"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="error-card">
          <strong>Una pieza no respondió.</strong>
          <p>Estamos mostrando una salida segura mientras el servicio vuelve a estar disponible.</p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<script>
  const retryBtn = document.getElementById('retryBtn');
  if (retryBtn) {
    retryBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      window.location.reload();
    });
  }
</script>

<style>
  .page-500 {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: #fff;
    min-height: calc(100vh - 78px - 300px);
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    padding: 64px 0 90px;
  }

  .grid-500 {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 75px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .eyebrow-acid {
    color: var(--lime);
  }

  .code-500 {
    font: 800 clamp(7.5rem, 18vw, 15rem) / 0.8 "Manrope", sans-serif;
    letter-spacing: -0.095em;
    margin: 22px 0;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .code-500 span {
    color: var(--orange);
  }

  .page-500 h1 {
    font: 800 clamp(2.8rem, 5vw, 5.3rem) / 0.96 "Manrope", sans-serif;
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
  }

  .copy {
    color: #b9c0cf;
    font-size: 1.12rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    max-width: 650px;
  }

  .search-500 {
    margin-top: 26px;
    display: flex;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 6px;
    max-width: 570px;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
  }

  .search-500 input {
    flex: 1;
    border: 0;
    background: transparent;
    padding: 0 16px;
    font: 600 1rem "DM Sans", sans-serif;
    color: #ffffff;
    outline: none;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .search-500 input::placeholder {
    color: #8E98AB;
  }

  .search-500 button {
    border: 0;
    background: var(--lime);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 900;
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 13px 22px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: transform 0.2s;
  }

  .search-500 button:hover {
    transform: scale(1.02);
  }

  .actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }

  .btn-outline {
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.24);
    background: transparent;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .btn-outline:hover {
    border-color: #fff;
  }

  .incident {
    margin-top: 28px;
    color: #7f899c;
    font: 600 0.78rem / 1.6 "DM Sans", sans-serif;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }

  .machine {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 520px;
  }

  .panel-500 {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 40px 15px 65px;
    background: #151c30;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    border-radius: 34px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .panel-head {
    height: 58px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0 22px;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .dot-500 {
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #414b61;
  }

  .dot-500.orange {
    background: var(--orange);
  }

  .dot-500.yellow {
    background: #ffd45c;
  }

  .dot-500.lime {
    background: var(--lime);
  }

  .screen-500 {
    padding: 42px 36px;
  }

  .line-500 {
    height: 12px;
    background: #273149;
    border-radius: 999px;
    margin: 17px 0;
  }

  .line-500.v {
    width: 72%;
    background: var(--violet);
  }

  .line-500:nth-child(2) {
    width: 94%;
  }

  .line-500:nth-child(3) {
    width: 58%;
  }

  .line-500.o {
    width: 84%;
    background: var(--orange);
  }

  .line-500:nth-child(5) {
    width: 43%;
  }

  .error-card {
    position: absolute;
    right: -5px;
    bottom: 18px;
    width: 73%;
    background: var(--cream);
    color: var(--ink);
    border-radius: 26px;
    padding: 26px;
    transform: rotate(4deg);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }

  .error-card strong {
    display: block;
    font: 800 1.85rem / 1.08 "Manrope", sans-serif;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }

  .error-card p {
    color: #5c6475;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    margin-top: 6px;
  }

  .bolt {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    width: 105px;
    height: 165px;
    background: var(--orange);
    clip-path: polygon(55% 0, 100% 0, 64% 42%, 96% 42%, 21% 100%, 43% 55%, 12% 55%);
    transform: rotate(-8deg);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .grid-500 {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .machine {
      min-height: 390px;
    }
    .panel-500 {
      inset: 20px 10px 55px;
    }
    .code-500 {
      font-size: clamp(7rem, 30vw, 12rem);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .page-500 {
      padding-top: 38px;
    }
    .machine {
      min-height: 330px;
    }
    .screen-500 {
      padding: 28px 24px;
    }
    .error-card {
      width: 88%;
      padding: 21px;
    }
    .actions .btn {
      flex: 1;
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }
</style>
